    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>bKlug AI for WooCommerce is a plugin developed by bKlug that enhances your customers&#8217; experience with AI capabilities provided by the bKlug platform.</p>\n",
        "installation": "",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20happens%20if%20woocommerce%20is%20not%20installed%3F'>\nWhat happens if WooCommerce is not installed?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The plugin will display a notice in the WordPress admin panel, informing that WooCommerce is required for it to function.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20this%20plugin%20work%20without%20the%20bklug%20ai%20platform%3F'>\nDoes this plugin work without the bKlug AI platform?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You need to have an active account on the bKlug platform.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial version.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Declares compatibility with HPOS WooCommerce</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add product that does not have a variant with configured attribute</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add products without variants using attributes in the main product</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
